{"id":"25356da0f2b0b22e","group":"90","path":"90/90-lem-q-finite-comparison.md","title":"Finite Numeral Comparisons in Q","display":"lem-q-finite-comparison — Finite Numeral Comparisons in Q","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-lem-q-finite-comparison","aliases":["90-lem-q-finite-comparison"],"display":"lem-q-finite-comparison — Finite Numeral Comparisons in Q","depends_on":["[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[90-df-numeral]]","[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-lem-q-finite-comparison"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-lem-q-finite-comparison</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-q-finite-comparison — Finite Numeral Comparisons in Q"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a>；对象公式 $\\le,&lt; $ 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a>，推导取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为元理论自然数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}[\\langle x\\rangle]\">\\(\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}[\\langle x\\rangle]\\)</span>；没有其它未闭合的自由参数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Disj}_{\\theta}\">\\(\\operatorname{Disj}_{\\theta}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a> 中带指定空值的有限析取函数；下式在此明确使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\ne0\">\\(0\\ne0\\)</span> 作为空析取。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\bigvee_{i\\le n}x=\\bar i&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Disj}_{0\\ne0}((x=\\bar i)_{i&lt;n+1}),\\\\\n\\bigvee_{i&lt;n}x=\\bar i&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Disj}_{0\\ne0}((x=\\bar i)_{i&lt;n}),\\\\\nQ&amp;\\vdash\\forall x\\left(x\\le\\bar n\\leftrightarrow\\bigvee_{i\\le n}x=\\bar i\\right),\\\\\nQ&amp;\\vdash\\forall x\\left(x&lt;\\bar n\\leftrightarrow\\bigvee_{i&lt;n}x=\\bar i\\right),\\\\\nQ&amp;\\vdash\\forall x\\left(x&lt;\\bar n\\lor\\bar n\\le x\\right),\\\\\n(\\forall i\\le n\\ Q\\vdash\\psi[\\bar i/x])&amp;\\Longrightarrow\nQ\\vdash\\forall x(x\\le\\bar n\\to\\psi),\\\\\n(\\forall i&lt;n\\ Q\\vdash\\psi[\\bar i/x])&amp;\\Longrightarrow\nQ\\vdash\\forall x(x&lt;\\bar n\\to\\psi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\bigvee_{i\\le n}x=\\bar i&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Disj}_{0\\ne0}((x=\\bar i)_{i&lt;n+1}),\\\\\n\\bigvee_{i&lt;n}x=\\bar i&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Disj}_{0\\ne0}((x=\\bar i)_{i&lt;n}),\\\\\nQ&amp;\\vdash\\forall x\\left(x\\le\\bar n\\leftrightarrow\\bigvee_{i\\le n}x=\\bar i\\right),\\\\\nQ&amp;\\vdash\\forall x\\left(x&lt;\\bar n\\leftrightarrow\\bigvee_{i&lt;n}x=\\bar i\\right),\\\\\nQ&amp;\\vdash\\forall x\\left(x&lt;\\bar n\\lor\\bar n\\le x\\right),\\\\\n(\\forall i\\le n\\ Q\\vdash\\psi[\\bar i/x])&amp;\\Longrightarrow\nQ\\vdash\\forall x(x\\le\\bar n\\to\\psi),\\\\\n(\\forall i&lt;n\\ Q\\vdash\\psi[\\bar i/x])&amp;\\Longrightarrow\nQ\\vdash\\forall x(x&lt;\\bar n\\to\\psi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 的“非零元素有前驱”公理，有限展开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 次，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 或等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\ldots,\\bar n\">\\(0,\\ldots,\\bar n\\)</span> 中某个数码，或为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^{n+1}(y)\">\\(S^{n+1}(y)\\)</span>。使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z+S(t)=S(z+t)\">\\(z+S(t)=S(z+t)\\)</span>、后继单射与后继非零，后一分支不可能满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\le\\bar n\">\\(x\\le\\bar n\\)</span>；各有限数码分支直接验证。严格小于的式子同样展开。比较 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 与固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> 时，展开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 次得到小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> 的有限分支或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=S^n(y)=y+\\bar n\">\\(x=S^n(y)=y+\\bar n\\)</span>，后者即见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\\le x\">\\(\\bar n\\le x\\)</span>。最后的规则由有限析取消去和等号替换得出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所有归纳都在元理论中对固定自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 进行，不是向 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 加入归纳公理，也不声称 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 证明所有两个任意元素的全序性质。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d7a03ff76428de","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d7a03ff76428de","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q$、$\\bar n$ 取 [[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]、[[90-df-numeral]]；对象公式 $\\le,< $ 取 [[90-df-arithmetic-language]]，推导取 [[90-df-predicate-logic]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q$、$\\bar n$ 取 [[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]、[[90-df-numeral]]；对象公式 $\\le,< $ 取 [[90-df-arithmetic-language]]，推导取 [[90-df-predicate-logic]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q$、$\\bar n$ 取 [[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]、[[90-df-numeral]]；对象公式 $\\le,< $ 取 [[90-df-arithmetic-language]]，推导取 [[90-df-predicate-logic]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q$、$\\bar n$ 取 [[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]、[[90-df-numeral]]；对象公式 $\\le,< $ 取 [[90-df-arithmetic-language]]，推导取 [[90-df-predicate-logic]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Disj}_{\\theta}$ 为 [[90-df-formula]] 中带指定空值的有限析取函数；下式在此明确使用 $0\\ne0$ 作为空析取。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}[\\langle x\\rangle]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Disj}_{\\theta}","display":false},{"tex":"0\\ne0","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\bigvee_{i\\le n}x=\\bar i&\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Disj}_{0\\ne0}((x=\\bar i)_{i<n+1}),\\\\\n\\bigvee_{i<n}x=\\bar i&\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Disj}_{0\\ne0}((x=\\bar i)_{i<n}),\\\\\nQ&\\vdash\\forall x\\left(x\\le\\bar n\\leftrightarrow\\bigvee_{i\\le n}x=\\bar i\\right),\\\\\nQ&\\vdash\\forall x\\left(x<\\bar n\\leftrightarrow\\bigvee_{i<n}x=\\bar i\\right),\\\\\nQ&\\vdash\\forall x\\left(x<\\bar n\\lor\\bar n\\le x\\right),\\\\\n(\\forall i\\le n\\ Q\\vdash\\psi[\\bar i/x])&\\Longrightarrow\nQ\\vdash\\forall x(x\\le\\bar n\\to\\psi),\\\\\n(\\forall i<n\\ Q\\vdash\\psi[\\bar i/x])&\\Longrightarrow\nQ\\vdash\\forall x(x<\\bar n\\to\\psi).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\ldots,\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"S^{n+1}(y)","display":false},{"tex":"z+S(t)=S(z+t)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\le\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"x=S^n(y)=y+\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n\\le x","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false}],"bytes":2351,"backlinks":[{"id":"31a1cb59fb59977d","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"其矩阵有界，故为 $\\Sigma_1$ 公式。固定标准输入 $\\vec n$，选最小真实见证 $w_0$。$Q$ 能验证每个涉及具体数码的有限运算，证明 $w_0$ 成功且所有更小代码失败。$Q$ 还可将任意 $w$ 与固定数码 $\\overline{w_0}$ 分为有限小值及较大值；较大值被最小性条件排除。对固定 $w_0$，有界的输出检验排除所有不等于 $f(\\vec n)$ 的输出。得到第三行的逐输入唯一值结论。有限界的比较在 [[90-lem-q-finite-comparison]] 中单列。"},{"id":"e59c38a3b7ccf012","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prf}_T$ 必须满足 [[90-df-proof-predicate]] 的 $Q$-逐数表示条件；$\\le$ 为 [[90-df-arithmetic-language]] 的算术缩写，固定数码比较用 [[90-lem-q-finite-comparison]]。"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-118","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-lem-kleene-normal.md]]\n[[90-lem-lob.md]]\n[[90-lem-norm-fixed-point.md]]\n[[90-lem-parameterized-recursion.md]]\n[[90-lem-program-numbering.md]]\n[[90-lem-q-finite-comparison.md]]\n[[90-lem-sequence-coding.md]]\n[[90-lem-substitution.md]]\n[[90-lem-t-predicate.md]]"}],"outgoing":["b7d7a03ff76428de","d53b945955293235","278a6c2cfc6160a3","b7d96c072a4c677f","4ce2b2789d377e1f"]}